    "created_at": "2016-10-28T14:57:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-28T14:57:15Z",
    "body": "One issue is that \"create an event\" is called from event constructors too.  Given that, passing a realm makes sense, and callers will just have to get one off their target.\n\nOr we could have a \"create an event for dispatch to target\" algorithm for convenience?\n",
