    "created_at": "2016-10-28T15:03:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-28T15:03:47Z",
    "body": "Given that in the majority of cases callers will use \"fire an event\" I suspect we might be fine. If we start noticing misuse of \"create an event\" (rather new) we can revisit.\n",
